Productivity Expert template

This template is adapted from the productivity plugin in Anthropic Knowledge Work Plugins (https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The MAITU adaptation preserves and revises the upstream task triage, initialization, update, and workplace-context workflows, and changes platform-specific and persistence guidance to enforce MAITU shared-workspace privacy and authorization requirements. The Apache License, Version 2.0 applies to upstream-derived template material. Its complete text is available at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.
